notes = "Firmware is optional: the core starts games without it. The BIOS is read only when the Boot option is BIOS; each file serves one region (U export NTSC, E export PAL with TV = PAL, J Japan), and a missing or unusable file means fast boot with one warning."
is_experimental = "true"
description = "Experimental. Sega Master System and Game Gear core with sound (SN76489 with Game Gear stereo, YM2413 for Japanese content) and identical frames and audio on every platform. Compatibility is measured by narrow per-title checks; titles with no check are listed unknown."
